<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/$0.50 off - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/$0.50 off - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were weak</p>
<p>to $0.50 lower. Demand and movement were light to moderate. Top</p>
<p>$60.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>				 Country				Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 LBS  58.00-59.00 Few 57.50 &amp; 59.50  58.50-60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 LBS  52.50-57.50			    Few 60.25</p>
<p>	  210-230 LBS  47.50-52.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady on a light movement. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 LBS  43.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 LBS  46.00-48.00</p>
<p>Few over 600 LBS  48.00-49.00</p>
</text>
